{
 "_readme": "Bass pattern library (2026-10-19). Each entry is 1-4 bars of 16 steps. 'bars': when a note hits (X accent, x normal, o soft, . ghost/dead note, - rest). 'roles' (same positions): which note plays -- R chord root, 5 fifth above, L fifth below, 8 octave up, 3 third of the chord, 7 seventh of the chord, u next step up the key, d next step down the key, a chromatic approach into the next chord's root (final bar only), n the next chord's root played early (final bar only). The note is always taken from the chord and key, and a role the bass file can't reach plays the root. The bass plays one note at a time; each note runs to the next hit. Used only by beats stamped bass_flow 2 or higher; older beats rebuild exactly as made. To add one: copy any entry and change it.",
